//! The system-prompt text of the data science toolkit's chat tools (the tools are in `iyakki-agent`).

pub const PROMPT_RULE: &str = "\nDATA SCIENCE TOOLKIT (Store, Setup, Linux apps; F-FLOW-31): datasci_status says whether the toolkit (Python with scikit-learn, NumPy, SciPy and OpenCV) is installed, current or behind this IYAKKI's pins (free). datasci_verify runs its self-test again in the Linux apps sandbox with no network (asks). python_run runs a script you write (Python 3, up to 20000 characters, 60 seconds by default and 300 at most) in that sandbox with no network and an empty work folder, and returns what it printed and the files it made; the person reads the whole script on a card first and every run asks. Installing and upgrading the toolkit are buttons on the Store's Setup page (the licence text and the size come first); you cannot start them.";
